{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Dotly 是一款主打私密與離線使用的每日活動追蹤工具，適合想建立習慣、記錄日常流程或提升個人效率的用戶；所有資料只留在裝置，毋須帳戶，亦不設廣告。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-64.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線私密活動追蹤</h2>\n<p>Dotly 以簡潔無干擾介面記錄活動，毋須設定即可上手，並可建立無限自訂分類，方便追蹤習慣、日常流程或工作效率。它完全離線運作，沒有背景同步與多餘功能，資料只存於裝置，不設帳戶、追蹤或分析；輕巧設計讓用戶隨時記錄，同時保持私密與自主。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Dotly – Activity Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/dotly-activity-tracker/id6758864475?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:22.950628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:35.043084+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:35.043084+00:00","content_hash":"29913192ce6bb54fd393a4ce61472289b9642e4add10c6de41c96b1eb8316e60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}